6393090_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kx4Vgs64GsgQ7kNvwERzH8K&_nc_oc=AdkITcioBKvqfLdHVuajySycz46Uk9mM6fyAQJyXp7x8E09gBmG-8GnhZgHPZwPHAs4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxOOkA_na1RvulUEDf5XGYM2bONfGpbviku0RikwUEJqg&oe=69BFE7F6"}, {"file_name": "magiclab.png", "id": "571678028809339", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982452_571678032142672_4802457235566616749_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mJqhBMqj5BIQ7kNvwHFCwPr&_nc_oc=AdmuCd49ZTmIjkJJWACb7J6fiYh_IgJuFRjpbfcZsqv6bZnh_LJFEoAAOyAbx6k5w3g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxGviaEVK1Lg3tN3YWv0xGyO0z3REyH2RE_em8nD5sbwA&oe=69BFF173"}, {"file_name": "Store Images-6.png", "id": "1345003753277335", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307555_1345003756610668_1826594110833715176_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7lQrwb--nwkQ7kNvwFLuAiz&_nc_oc=Adml0VIBsNQi9VHzSUOOHrLXurxZBCf3FLGRECjem9fxHoDbwA8IQRmVKSHvU7tBxY8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyeCk_2ESNiHRBg-LdDVxz6yRd1vTgf-842r61Dl6KAJg&oe=69BFFC7E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wizard Simulator", "keywords": ["magic", "wand", "duel", "wizard", "rpg"], "long_description": "# Master Magic Spells\nHarness the power of your wand to cast incredible spells with precision. Summon fire, control the elements, and unlock new magical abilities as you explore a mystical world.\n\n# Brew Powerful Potions\nDive into the art of potion-making! Combine rare ingredients, experiment with recipes, and create potions that heal, enhance, or devastate in the heat of battle.\n\n# Duel Other Players\nOutsmart your opponents with quick reflexes and strategic spellcasting in intense multiplayer battles.\n\nAre you ready to become the ultimate wizard?\n\n{1411794410259308}", "short_description": "Cast magic spells, brew powerful potions, and duel other players in epi